# 2029.sk: Iconic Amen Break Chop & Sub Bass 16-Step Groove
# -------------------------------------------------------------
M 165

# Wave Slots:
# 100: Kick
# 101: Snare (Crisp Amen Snare)
# 102: Closed Hi-Hat
# 103: Open Hi-Hat
# 104: Sub Bass
[sk/drums-kick.ks]/ks 1 k>d d>r /r100
[sk/drums-snare.ks]/ks 1 k>d d>r /r101
[sk/drums-chh.ks]/ks 1 k>d d>r /r102
[sk/drums-ohh.ks]/ks 1 k>d d>r /r103
[sk/gm-bass-sub.ks]/ks 1 k>d d>r /r104

# Voice Assignments:
v0 w100 f440 a10          # Kick (Natural unpitched playback)
v1 w101 f440 a8           # Snare
v2 w102 f440 a3           # Closed Hat
v3 w103 f440 a5           # Open Hat
v4 w104 f440 a10          # Sub Bass (Pitched via note numbers)

# 16-Step Pattern (Full 4/4 Bar @ 165 BPM)
y0
[v0l1 v4n24l1] x0         # Beat 1 Amen Kick + Sub Bass
[v2l0.4] x1
[v1l0.25] x2              # Soft Ghost Snare
[v2l0.4] x3
[v1l1] x4                 # Beat 2 Snare Backbeat
[v2l0.4] x5
[v0l0.8 v4n24l1] x6       # Syncopated Amen Kick
[v1l0.25] x7              # Ghost Snare
[v0l1] x8                 # Beat 3 Kick
[v1l0.9] x9               # Amen Syncopated Snare Hit!
[v0l0.8 v4n29l1] x10      # Kick + Sub F1
[v2l0.4] x11
[v1l1] x12                # Beat 4 Snare Backbeat
[v2l0.4] x13
[v1l0.3 v3l0.8] x14       # Ghost Snare + Open Hat Accent
[v1l0.9 z*4] x15          # 4-Trigger Amen Snare Roll Fill!

# Start Pattern
Z1
